-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data sources (queried at runtime, not embedded)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Module release and security data is read live from:
  - drupal.org release-history API  (https://updates.drupal.org)
  - Packagist security advisories   (https://packagist.org)

These are queried at audit time; no advisory data is bundled in this tool
(a bundled security snapshot would go stale and give false assurance). The
end-of-life / branch-support logic and the rule set are drupalens's own.

